                         component    fp32    fp16   8-bit   4-bit
              SD 1.5 U-Net (0.86B)    3.4G    1.7G    0.9G    0.4G
                 SDXL U-Net (2.6B)   10.4G    5.2G    2.6G    1.3G
  SD3 / Flux-class DiT (about 12B)   48.0G   24.0G   12.0G    6.0G
        T5-XXL text encoder (4.7B)   18.8G    9.4G    4.7G    2.4G
a 12B DiT in fp16 needs about 24.0 GB for weights alone, so consumer GPUs use 8-bit/4-bit weights and offload the text encoder
